    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1888, Hugh J. Chisholm built the Otis Falls Pulp & Paper Company, harnessing Androscoggin River water power.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chisholm%2C_Maine"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The arrival of the railroad transformed Chisholm from a small farming community into a bustling industrial town.",
